      "heading": "Two properties, competing SALN comparisons",
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Attorney Cathy Florence M. Baldonado, Register of Deeds IV of Davao City, and Attorney Marco K. Pineda, Deputy Register of Deeds III, designated Acting Register of Deeds of Island Garden City of Samal and concurrently Assisting Register of Deeds of Davao City, testified about two properties. The prosecution and defense disputed whether properties titled to Manases Carpio, married to Vice President Sara Duterte, corresponded to entries in her statements of assets, liabilities and net worth, or SALNs. The prosecution alleged nondisclosure. The defense said both properties were declared in the spouse sections."
    },
