      "heading": "Davao documents",
      "id": "P003",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Baldonado described a 379-square-meter property in Matina. Supporting records placed it in Huna Subdivision, Matina Crossing, Talomo. She read a six-million-peso sale consideration and clarified that the deed was dated July 2, 2024. She also read an August 27, 2024 mortgage annotation for eight million pesos in favor of Philippine Savings Bank. On cross-examination, a newer tax declaration and a 2024 SALN spouse entry both showed a land assessed value of 82,046 pesos. The SALN entry described Barangay 74-A and recorded a ten-million-peso acquisition cost. Baldonado declined to confirm that it identified the titled property."
    },
