      "heading": "Samal documents",
      "id": "P005",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "For Samal, Pineda read a second set of property records. The defense stipulated to a 751-square-meter title naming Carpio, married to Duterte, and an annotated price of 3,453,849 pesos. Pineda read March 15, 2018 as the deed date. The title, issued March 28, 2019, described Matanos; the deed described San Isidro, Kaputian District. He read a San Isidro spouse entry in the 2018 SALN and a Matanos entry in 2019. Both recorded acquisition in 2013 at a cost of 4,041,000 pesos. He declined to identify the property from a quick visual comparison."
    },
