      "heading": "Samal identity remained contested",
      "id": "P006",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "A tax declaration bearing the same title number and the 2024 SALN Matanos spouse entry both showed an assessed value of 346,960 pesos. Escudero qualified that comparison: document contents matched, while property identity remained open. Flores emphasized the different acquisition years and amounts. Bacquel explored installment arrangements and later title transfer. Pineda explained that derivative titles carry older cadastral descriptions forward, while the current tax declaration placed the land in San Isidro. Asked by Escudero whether full payment explained later sale entries, he said he had no personal knowledge."
    },
