      "heading": "Senator questions and witness limits",
      "id": "P007",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian tested how title locations matched supporting records and SALNs, and questioned the Samal price difference. Sen. Joel Villanueva distinguished the title's married-to wording from joint ownership and sought a financial trail linking the acquisition to Article Two. Baldonado could not identify who actually paid or where the money came from. Sen. Erwin Tulfo asked about resale, SALN reporting and the source of purchase funds. Pineda said the registry had no source-of-funds paper trail and lacked personal knowledge of the spouses' marital property regime."
    },
